OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANorthern line extension celebrates
OL,4,Acentenary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe seven stations on the route - also
OL,7,Fincluding South Wimbledon, Colliers
OL,8,FWood, Tooting Broadway, Tooting Bec and
OL,9,Fand Balham, were designed by architect
OL,10,FCharles Holden and built in a modernist
OL,11,Fstyle, marking a change of direction
OL,12,Ffor Underground design.
OL,14,FThe Transport for London (TfL) event on
OL,15,FSaturday will explore spots along the
OL,16,Froute and showcase Holden's
OL,17,Farchitecture.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
